cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TeaCat in your work, cite it as below."
title: "TeaCat: a local LLM runtime by Tyxen"
abstract: >-
  TeaCat is a free, open-source local language-model runtime written in Go.
  It loads GGUF models, performs inference with its own transformer engine,
  and exposes Ollama-compatible and OpenAI-compatible HTTP APIs.
authors:
  - name: Tyxen
version: 0.3.1
date-released: 2026-11-07
url: "https://tyxteacat.github.io/teacat/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tyxteacat/teacat"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - TeaCat
  - TeaCat Tyxen
  - Tyxen
  - local LLM
  - GGUF
  - Ollama alternative
  - OpenAI-compatible
  - Go
